    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i'm just really paranoid about hospitals... the wait times are insane and i honestly feel okay now that the headache is settling down a bit. my doctor actually told me last year that i'm prone to complex migraines that can feel really weird. are you sure it cant just be a really intense aura? it's happened in smaller ways before.",
