    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but like, if it was a stroke wouldn't it be more constant?? it's already fading. i have some sumatriptan left over from my old prescription, can i just take a couple of those and then just sleep it off? i really dont think i need to go to the hospital for something that's already getting better.",
